<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-William bids for Terra.</title>
<headline>RTRS-William bids for Terra.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian miner William Resources Inc said it has made a 162.50 crowns per share bid for Swedish gold miner Terra Mining AB.</p>
<p>In a statement issued by the Australian Stock Exchange, William said Terra's 42.3 percent shareholder Norsk Hydro ASA had entered into an agreement to accept the offer.</p>
<p>It said the bid was made by its Swedish unit WRI Holding AB and represented a 23 percent premium on Terra Mining's closing price on November 1. The offer is the equivalent of C$33.25 per share, William Resources said.</p>
<p>William's shares are listed on the Australian exchange.</p>
</text>
